Audio Duration: 5m 6.8s (306.78s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 13:17:23 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 0.99)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,100] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 10 | Text: 澳門有個朋友做比特幣的
Segment #2   [00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:03,900] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 12 | Text: 媽去年千年振了這兩三個億
Segment #3   [00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:05,240] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 跟他在一起吃飯的時候
Segment #4   [00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:05,760] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 3  | Text: 他說小刀
Segment #5   [00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:07,640] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 9  | Text: 你知道我最喜歡你哪篇作品
Segment #6   [00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:08,960] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 4  | Text: 我說哪一篇
Segment #7   [00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:11,260] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 10 | Text: 他說就是那篇關於沉默成本
Segment #8   [00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:12,440] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 6  | Text: 不是成本那一篇
Segment #9   [00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:13,320] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 1  | Text: 好吧
Segment #10  [00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:14,560] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 聽說第二次發揮夥
Segment #11  [00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:15,840] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 今天專門錄個視頻
Segment #12  [00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,620] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 11 | Text: 再講一下經濟學歷的這句話
Segment #13  [00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:19,020] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是沉默成本
Segment #14  [00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:19,820] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 3  | Text: 不是成本
Segment #15  [00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:22,700] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 12 | Text: 我們先看一下大家有沒有一個做生意的頭腦
Segment #16  [00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,240] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 9  | Text: 適不適合做一個生意人
Segment #17  [00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:26,240] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 8  | Text: 有一個很簡單的小測試
Segment #18  [00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:27,140] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 3  | Text: 我來說一下
Segment #19  [00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:27,820] | Elapsed:  14.01s | Words: 4  | Text: 你們算一算
Segment #20  [00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:30,340] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 10 | Text: 有一個人到吉士上去買牛
Segment #21  [00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:31,920] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 10 | Text: 花了500塊錢買了一頭牛
Segment #22  [00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:33,420] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 買完之後轉數
Segment #23  [00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:35,380] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 8  | Text: 600塊錢賣給了別人
Segment #24  [00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:36,280] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 賣完之後他感覺
Segment #25  [00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:37,560] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 8  | Text: 我超過好像賣便宜了
Segment #26  [00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:38,400] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 又找到那個人
Segment #27  [00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:40,000] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 8  | Text: 花了700塊錢買了回來
Segment #28  [00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,360] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 12 | Text: 然後等到下午吉士快要結束的時候
Segment #29  [00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:43,720] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 800塊錢賣了出去
Segment #30  [00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:45,820] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 然後在這個過程之中
Segment #31  [00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:47,780] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 8  | Text: 這個人是賺了還是賠了
Segment #32  [00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:49,660] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 8  | Text: 如果說是賺賺了多少錢
Segment #33  [00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:51,580] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 9  | Text: 如果說是賠是賠了多少錢
Segment #34  [00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:53,280] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 在時候你可以想的很簡單
Segment #35  [00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:54,580] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是他500賣的
Segment #36  [00:00:54,580 --> 00:00:55,720] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 3  | Text: 600賣的
Segment #37  [00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:56,740] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 感覺媽賣虧了
Segment #38  [00:00:56,740 --> 00:00:57,800] | Elapsed:  30.68s | Words: 8  | Text: 又花了700塊錢買回來
Segment #39  [00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:59,260] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 6  | Text: 然後800塊錢賣出去
Segment #40  [00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:00,640] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 4  | Text: 你看到這個地方
Segment #41  [00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:01,880] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 5  | Text: 你點下暫停
Segment #42  [00:01:02,380 --> 00:01:03,580] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 5  | Text: 你拿筆算一下
Segment #43  [00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:05,900] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 11 | Text: 算完之後你再重新看這個視頻
Segment #44  [00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:08,760] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 1  | Text: OK
Segment #45  [00:01:08,760 --> 00:01:09,940] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 5  | Text: 你的結果出來了嗎
Segment #46  [00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:11,180] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 4  | Text: 我來告訴你
Segment #47  [00:01:11,180 --> 00:01:12,200] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 5  | Text: 他賺了200塊
Segment #48  [00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:13,420] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 2  | Text: 為什麼呢
Segment #49  [00:01:13,420 --> 00:01:14,420] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是因為你可以把他
Segment #50  [00:01:14,420 --> 00:01:16,440] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 11 | Text: 看到成兩次的獨立買賣行為
Segment #51  [00:01:17,060 --> 00:01:17,460] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 1  | Text: 對吧
Segment #52  [00:01:17,460 --> 00:01:19,140] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 8  | Text: 500買的600賣的賺100
Segment #53  [00:01:19,140 --> 00:01:21,240] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 10 | Text: 700買的800又賣的又賺100
Segment #54  [00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:22,900] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 6  | Text: 很多人都會算錯
Segment #55  [00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:24,220] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 8  | Text: 主要錯在哪個環節
Segment #56  [00:01:24,220 --> 00:01:26,160] | Elapsed:  45.06s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是感覺自己600塊錢
Segment #57  [00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:27,060] | Elapsed:  59.87s | Words: 2  | Text: 賣出去
Segment #58  [00:01:27,060 --> 00:01:28,160] | Elapsed:  59.87s | Words: 6  | Text: 又700塊錢買回來
Segment #59  [00:01:28,160 --> 00:01:29,480] | Elapsed:  59.87s | Words: 6  | Text: 就感覺這個地方虧了
Segment #60  [00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:32,080] | Elapsed:  59.87s | Words: 12 | Text: 很多人是沒有這種做生意的頭腦的
Segment #61  [00:01:32,080 --> 00:01:33,620] | Elapsed:  59.87s | Words: 5  | Text: 最簡單的辦法是什麼
Segment #62  [00:01:33,620 --> 00:01:35,540] | Elapsed:  59.87s | Words: 5  | Text: 你把第二頭牛
Segment #63  [00:01:35,540 --> 00:01:37,140] | Elapsed:  59.87s | Words: 6  | Text: 看到成另外一頭牛
Segment #64  [00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:39,920] | Elapsed:  59.87s | Words: 13 | Text: 甚至你可以理解為是一匹馬一隻羊
Segment #65  [00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:41,780] | Elapsed:  59.87s | Words: 11 | Text: 你不就很簡單的可以理解了嗎
Segment #66  [00:01:41,780 --> 00:01:44,420] | Elapsed:  59.87s | Words: 10 | Text: 這就是兩個獨立的賣賣行為
Segment #67  [00:01:44,420 --> 00:01:45,380] | Elapsed:  59.87s | Words: 6  | Text: 或者說你理解成
Segment #68  [00:01:45,820 --> 00:01:47,440] | Elapsed:  59.87s | Words: 5  | Text: 買了一盆花
Segment #69  [00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:49,020] | Elapsed:  59.87s | Words: 8  | Text: 或者說買了一個垃圾桶
Segment #70  [00:01:49,620 --> 00:01:51,080] | Elapsed:  59.87s | Words: 7  | Text: 你就很簡單的理解了
Segment #71  [00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:51,820] | Elapsed:  59.87s | Words: 5  | Text: 買了賣賺100
Segment #72  [00:01:51,820 --> 00:01:53,000] | Elapsed:  59.87s | Words: 7  | Text: 買了又賣又賺100
Segment #73  [00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,720] | Elapsed:  74.75s | Words: 5  | Text: 很多人都會感覺
Segment #74  [00:01:55,260 --> 00:01:56,840] | Elapsed:  74.75s | Words: 5  | Text: 600塊錢賣出去
Segment #75  [00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,460] | Elapsed:  74.75s | Words: 9  | Text: 我為什麼要花700塊錢買回來
Segment #76  [00:01:58,460 --> 00:01:59,760] | Elapsed:  74.75s | Words: 3  | Text: 我會虧
Segment #77  [00:02:00,220 --> 00:02:02,740] | Elapsed:  74.75s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是因為沒有考慮掉沉默成本
Segment #78  [00:02:03,360 --> 00:02:04,540] | Elapsed:  74.75s | Words: 6  | Text: 什麼是沉默成本
Segment #79  [00:02:04,540 --> 00:02:06,680] | Elapsed:  74.75s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是已經沉默在水裡的成本
Segment #80  [00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:08,420] | Elapsed:  74.75s | Words: 9  | Text: 它就已經不再是成本了
Segment #81  [00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:10,240] | Elapsed:  74.75s | Words: 8  | Text: 比如說我們開了一個飯店
Segment #82  [00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:13,240] | Elapsed:  74.75s | Words: 12 | Text: 我們前期進行了詳細的市場調研
Segment #83  [00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:14,760] | Elapsed:  74.75s | Words: 6  | Text: 然後我覺得我適合開
Segment #84  [00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:15,740] | Elapsed:  74.75s | Words: 6  | Text: 我從飯店幹什麼
Segment #85  [00:02:15,740 --> 00:02:16,940] | Elapsed:  74.75s | Words: 7  | Text: 三年炒菜熟的了
Segment #86  [00:02:16,940 --> 00:02:18,200] | Elapsed:  74.75s | Words: 4  | Text: 然後開始裝修
Segment #87  [00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:19,340] | Elapsed:  74.75s | Words: 5  | Text: 買設備招供
Segment #88  [00:02:19,740 --> 00:02:21,460] | Elapsed:  74.75s | Words: 6  | Text: 最後發現這個商場的
Segment #89  [00:02:21,460 --> 00:02:22,520] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 6  | Text: 這個飯店的人流量
Segment #90  [00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:23,740] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 5  | Text: 達不到我們的預期
Segment #91  [00:02:23,740 --> 00:02:25,280] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 7  | Text: 這個飯店是虧錢的
Segment #92  [00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:26,900] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 7  | Text: 最正確的做法是什麼
Segment #93  [00:02:26,900 --> 00:02:28,080] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是即時止損
Segment #94  [00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:29,120] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 4  | Text: 關了飯店
Segment #95  [00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,540] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是很多人中想著
Segment #96  [00:02:30,540 --> 00:02:31,620] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 8  | Text: 哎呀我從那個飯店裡
Segment #97  [00:02:31,620 --> 00:02:33,520] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 9  | Text: 投入了太多的成本了
Segment #98  [00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:34,380] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 4  | Text: 裝修成本
Segment #99  [00:02:34,380 --> 00:02:35,240] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 4  | Text: 人工成本
Segment #100 [00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,800] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 8  | Text: 我是不是要再等一段時間
Segment #101 [00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:37,320] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 3  | Text: 看一看
Segment #102 [00:02:38,020 --> 00:02:39,840] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 6  | Text: 結果就是越等越虧
Segment #103 [00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:41,080] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 5  | Text: 它就是不知道止損
Segment #104 [00:02:42,220 --> 00:02:44,120] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 9  | Text: 那還有一些在感情上也是一樣
Segment #105 [00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,880] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 6  | Text: 假設我是一個女孩子
Segment #106 [00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:47,060] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 4  | Text: 我是一個女孩子
Segment #107 [00:02:47,060 --> 00:02:48,500] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 6  | Text: 我找了一個男朋友
Segment #108 [00:02:48,500 --> 00:02:50,280] | Elapsed:  90.18s | Words: 9  | Text: 跟他真正交往之後我發現
Segment #109 [00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,680] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 哎呀他喜歡喝酒
Segment #110 [00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:53,040] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 他還喜歡去澳門
Segment #111 [00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:54,800] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 有很多暴力行為
Segment #112 [00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:55,800] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 喝完酒總打我
Segment #113 [00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:58,000] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 9  | Text: 這種情況最正確的行為是什麼
Segment #114 [00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,060] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 9  | Text: 就是快速的拆掉他止損
Segment #115 [00:03:00,640 --> 00:03:01,640] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是很多人就會想著
Segment #116 [00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:02,080] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 3  | Text: 哎呀不行
Segment #117 [00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:03,660] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 我跟這個男孩子在一起
Segment #118 [00:03:03,660 --> 00:03:04,660] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 5  | Text: 已經好多年了
Segment #119 [00:03:04,660 --> 00:03:06,520] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 我們已經見過父母了
Segment #120 [00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,000] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 8  | Text: 我跟他同居那麼久了
Segment #121 [00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:09,560] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 我的青春從他那裡
Segment #122 [00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:10,740] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 耗費一大半的
Segment #123 [00:03:10,740 --> 00:03:11,880] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 4  | Text: 於是繼續的
Segment #124 [00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:13,660] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 11 | Text: 在這個錯誤的男人身上耗下去
Segment #125 [00:03:13,660 --> 00:03:15,020] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 4  | Text: 耗得越多
Segment #126 [00:03:15,020 --> 00:03:16,680] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 5  | Text: 你就越不知道止損
Segment #127 [00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,100] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是因為你從裡面
Segment #128 [00:03:18,100 --> 00:03:19,860] | Elapsed: 106.03s | Words: 8  | Text: 投入的成本太多了
